    "source": "Put a lasting modifier on a character or an enemy: a blessing, a curse, a potion, a hex, a wound that has not healed. Call it for anything that changes a number for a while and is not one of the 14 named 5e conditions; for those, use set_condition. Every modifier is applied by the server to the rolls it names, and the effect ends on its own when its duration runs out.",
